      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional requirements\n1. create a short url from a long url\n2. be redirected to the original url from a short url\n\nNon-functional requirements\n1. low latency on redirects\n2. scale to support 100M DAU and 1B urls\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional requirements\n1. create a short url from a long url\n2. be redirected to the original url from a short url\n\nNon-functional requirements\n1. low latency on redirects\n2. scale to support 100M DAU and 1B urls\n",
